1
00:00:00,606 --> 00:00:02,856
[BUZZER PLAYS OVER SPEAKER]

2
00:00:04,401 --> 00:00:07,571
(Sheldon:)All right, then,
my so-called friends have forsaken me.

3
00:00:07,738 --> 00:00:11,078
(Sheldon:)So I guess it'll just be me
and my eyewitness.

4
00:00:11,575 --> 00:00:13,785
(Penny:)Oh, balls.

5
00:00:13,952 --> 00:00:17,412
(Sheldon:)Try to wear something appropriate.
It won't help my case if the judge...

6
00:00:17,581 --> 00:00:21,371
...is busy trying to read the word "Juicy"
scrawled across your buttocks.

7
00:00:27,758 --> 00:00:29,928
Penny. Penny.

8
00:00:30,093 --> 00:00:31,883
(Sheldon:)Penny.

9
00:00:33,096 --> 00:00:37,056
(Sheldon:)-That's just wrong.
-All right, let's go.

10
00:00:37,226 --> 00:00:39,556
(Sheldon:)Wait. Hold on.
Before we get to the courthouse...

11
00:00:39,728 --> 00:00:42,768
(Sheldon:)...I'd like to call on your skills
as an actress.

12
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,070
(Penny:)What is this?

13
00:00:44,233 --> 00:00:47,773
(Sheldon:)I've taken the liberty of scripting
your appearance on the witness stand.

14
00:00:47,945 --> 00:00:49,615
(Sheldon:)You're somewhat of a loose cannon.

15
00:00:50,113 --> 00:00:53,533
(Sheldon:)Don't worry, it's written
in your vernacular. So shall we rehearse?

16
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:56,290
(Penny:)-Do I have a choice?
-Of course you have a choice.

17
00:00:56,453 --> 00:01:00,503
(Sheldon:)Although we live in a deterministic
universe, each individual has free will.

